									<font color=white size=5><b>Mid October - Aten Ha Ra Slain - EoD completes Luclin!</b></font><BR>
		                    	    <BR>
									<font color=white>
									On the 18th of October 27 Dread cleared from the zone in right the way through to Aten Ha Ra in around five hours.  Killing the most of the 2nd floor mobs flawlessly for the first time.  Aten her self was a fairly easy fight.  It is likely EoD could reduce its minimum break on Aten to as little as sixteen if needed.  Many didn't think we would progress so fast through Vex Thal as we did.  On many days we had no clerics at all and utilised druids and shaman as main healers - again killing some of the sub-bosses with as little as twelve.  <BR><BR>This marks the completion of Luclin with all of the zone bosses killed.  Of course we will still take the odd Emperor and Aten spawn but our focus now moves to PoP.  We have been flagging PoP at the same time as keying up in VT but now we will concentrate on making the leap into the Elemental Planes.<BR><BR>
										<a href="http://pdm-works.mmaweb.net/WebMain/UniImgDir/Guild_1/gsite/UI00000918.JPG" target="popimg"><img src="http://pdm-works.mmaweb.net/WebMain/UniImgDir/Guild_1/gsite/UI00000918.JPG" width=309 height=236 id=i1></a><BR>
										
										<a href="http://pdm-works.mmaweb.net/WebMain/UniImgDir/Guild_1/gsite/UI00000919.JPG" target="popimg"><img src="http://pdm-works.mmaweb.net/WebMain/UniImgDir/Guild_1/gsite/UI00000919.JPG" width=336 height=244 id=i2></a><BR>
										
      	              </td>
	                </tr>
	                
    		            <tr>
